title: Party Discipline
subtitle: The Zentrale can remove functionaries and expel members who break discipline.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: rf_party
view-if: rf_discipline_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rf_discipline_timer = 3

= Party Discipline

The leadership, now the <span class="f-[+ leader +]">[+ leader_name +]</span>, wants to act against factional work. The statutes allow it to remove functionaries and to expel members.

- @warn
- @remove_right
- @remove_left
- @remove_ultra
- @remove_stalin
- @expel

@warn
title: Issue a formal warning to all factions.
subtitle: Builds the apparatus. Every faction is irritated.
on-arrival: {!
Q.apparatus += 3;
for (var f of window.RF.factions) {
    if (f != Q.leader) { Q[f + '_dissent'] += 3; }
}
!}

The Zentrale warns that factional work will be punished. The factions take note and carry on.

@remove_right
title: Remove the Right's functionaries from their posts.
subtitle: Weakens the <span class="f-right">Right</span> and angers it badly.
view-if: right_expelled = 0 and leader != "right"
on-arrival: {!
Q.apparatus += 4;
Q.members -= 4;
Q.right_dissent += 12;
window.RF.shift(Q, 'right', Q.leader, 6);
!}

Brandler's supporters lose their editorships and district posts.

@remove_left
title: Remove the Left's functionaries from their posts.
subtitle: Weakens the <span class="f-left">Left</span> and angers it badly.
view-if: left_expelled = 0 and leader != "left"
on-arrival: {!
Q.apparatus += 4;
Q.members -= 4;
Q.left_dissent += 12;
window.RF.shift(Q, 'left', Q.leader, 6);
!}

Left functionaries in Berlin are replaced by reliable people.

@remove_ultra
title: Remove the Ultra-Left from its posts.
subtitle: Weakens the <span class="f-ultra">Ultra-Left</span> and angers it badly. Moscow approves.
view-if: ultra_expelled = 0 and leader != "ultra"
on-arrival: {!
Q.apparatus += 4;
Q.members -= 3;
Q.ultra_dissent += 12;
Q.moscow_trust += 3;
window.RF.shift(Q, 'ultra', Q.leader, 5);
!}

Korsch's and Scholem's people lose their seats on the district committees.

@remove_stalin
title: Move Thälmann's people out of their posts.
subtitle: Weakens <span class="f-stalin">Thälmann</span> and angers it badly. Moscow frowns.
view-if: stalin_expelled = 0 and leader != "stalin"
on-arrival: {!
Q.apparatus += 4;
Q.members -= 3;
Q.stalin_dissent += 12;
Q.moscow_trust -= 3;
window.RF.shift(Q, 'stalin', Q.leader, 5);
!}

Thälmann's Hamburg allies are moved to minor posts.

@expel
title: Expel the most rebellious faction's leaders.
subtitle: The faction leaves the party and takes members with it.
choose-if: (right_dissent >= 50 and right_expelled = 0 and leader != "right") or (center_dissent >= 50 and center_expelled = 0 and leader != "center") or (left_dissent >= 50 and left_expelled = 0 and leader != "left") or (ultra_dissent >= 50 and ultra_expelled = 0 and leader != "ultra") or (stalin_dissent >= 50 and stalin_expelled = 0 and leader != "stalin")
unavailable-subtitle: No faction outside the leadership is rebellious enough to justify expulsion (dissent 50 or more).
on-arrival: {!
var target = null;
for (var f of window.RF.factions) {
    if (f != Q.leader && !Q[f + '_expelled'] && (target === null || Q[f + '_dissent'] > Q[target + '_dissent'])) {
        target = f;
    }
}
Q.expelled_faction = target;
Q.expelled_name = window.RF.names[target];
Q.apparatus += 8;
window.RF.expel(Q, target);
!}

The leaders of the <span class="f-[+ expelled_faction +]">[+ expelled_name +]</span> are expelled for factional activity. Many of their followers leave with them. The party is more obedient, and smaller.
